5px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0Indian Army SSC Tech Recruitment 2025 : Training Details\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 29.0194%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Aspect</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.9806%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Details</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 29.0194%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Training Location</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.9806%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Officers Training Academy (OTA), Chennai, Tamil Nadu.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 29.0194%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Training Duration</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.9806%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">49 weeks (approximately 11 months).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 29.0194%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Type of Training</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.9806%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Rigorous military training to develop leadership, discipline, and technical expertise.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 29.0194%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Commission Awarded</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.9806%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">After successful completion, candidates are granted <strong>Short Service Commission (SSC)</strong> in the Indian Army.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 29.0194%; height: 25px; t