: 14pt;\">This section evaluates analytical and logical reasoning abilities, including topics like analysis, arithmetic number series, blood relations, decision making, and problem-solving.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.5188%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">General Awareness</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.4812%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Focuses on current events, important days, books and authors, geography, economy, and scientific research.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.5188%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">General English</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.4812%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Assesses understanding of the English language, covering active and passive voice, cloze tests, idioms and phrases, reading comprehension, synonyms, and antonyms.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.5188%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Numerical Aptitude</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.4812%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Tests mathematical skills, including basic operations, fractions, ratios, graphs, time, speed, distance, and profit and loss calculations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.5188%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Trade-Specific Knowledge</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.4812%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Evaluates expertise related to the specific trade for which the candidate has applied.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Indian Army SSC Tech Recruitment 2025\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-14348 size-full\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Indian-Army-SSC-Tech-Recruitment-2024-1024x576-1.jpg